{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01031",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.15,
      "end_seconds": 5.49,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "Hi, doctor, I hope I'm not disturbing you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.99,
      "end_seconds": 10.11,
      "duration_seconds": 4.12,
      "text": "Yes, have a seat. Tell me what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 11.32,
      "end_seconds": 16.73,
      "duration_seconds": 5.41,
      "text": "Yeah, morning, doctor. I'll stay and fill in anything that's missed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 21.06,
      "end_seconds": 27.58,
      "duration_seconds": 6.52,
      "text": "I wanted to get a dry cough in the evenings looked at."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 33.02,
      "end_seconds": 36.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "When was the first time you noticed it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.38,
      "end_seconds": 43.74,
      "duration_seconds": 5.36,
      "text": "Uh, it's been two months, I'm fairly sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 44.25,
      "end_seconds": 51.32,
      "duration_seconds": 7.07,
      "text": "Yes, carry on. Okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.87,
      "end_seconds": 65.99,
      "duration_seconds": 14.12,
      "text": "Hmm, it settles a little with antihistamine. Pollen season definitely sets it off. Ah, I did have sneezing fits at one point, but that's gone now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.27,
      "end_seconds": 69.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "Do you have any long-term conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 71.9,
      "end_seconds": 88.68,
      "duration_seconds": 16.78,
      "text": "I have thin bones, for about a year. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it. I've had anxiety for two years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.66,
      "end_seconds": 97.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "Any past operations I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.65,
      "end_seconds": 109.22,
      "duration_seconds": 9.57,
      "text": "Uh, uh, I had a mole taken off my arm a few years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.97,
      "end_seconds": 126.32,
      "duration_seconds": 5.35,
      "text": "So, tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.18,
      "end_seconds": 138.3,
      "duration_seconds": 10.12,
      "text": "I work in accounts at a hospital. Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit. I walk the dog every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.92,
      "end_seconds": 143.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "Do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.44,
      "end_seconds": 149.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.72,
      "text": "Escitalopram, 10 milligrams, once a day for the anxiety."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.47,
      "end_seconds": 167.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "Any wheeze, fever or shortness of breath?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 168.29,
      "end_seconds": 171.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "Ah, no, I'd have said so."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.07,
      "end_seconds": 175.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "Okay, go on. Is your urine normal, no changes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 176.99,
      "end_seconds": 179.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "No, that's all fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.21,
      "end_seconds": 184.68,
      "duration_seconds": 4.47,
      "text": "Can I check a few measurements before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 197.73,
      "end_seconds": 199.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "Sit still for a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.57,
      "end_seconds": 225.4,
      "duration_seconds": 9.83,
      "text": "Okay: oxygen saturation is 99 percent, respiratory rate 14. And blood pressure 126 over 81, heart rate 80, temperature is 36.6 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 226.26,
      "end_seconds": 227.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.54,
      "end_seconds": 232.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "That's fine, I'll explain it soon."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.95,
      "end_seconds": 240.36,
      "duration_seconds": 5.41,
      "text": "I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.4,
      "end_seconds": 243.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "Hold that for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.3,
      "end_seconds": 262.18,
      "duration_seconds": 4.88,
      "text": "Your chest is clear and your nose looks a little swollen inside."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.55,
      "end_seconds": 280.59,
      "duration_seconds": 16.04,
      "text": "Okay, that's enough for me. From what you've told me and what I found, I think we're dealing with seasonal hay fever causing the cough at this stage. It could also be early asthma, so we'll keep that open."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 282.09,
      "end_seconds": 286.35,
      "duration_seconds": 4.26,
      "text": "Well, do you think it's something serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 287.01,
      "end_seconds": 296.78,
      "duration_seconds": 9.77,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's seasonal hay fever causing the cough, and we'll watch how it goes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.35,
      "end_seconds": 330.1,
      "duration_seconds": 17.75,
      "text": "Let's use fluticasone nasal spray, 50 micrograms, once a day, for the season. It's for hay fever. Keep windows closed on high-pollen days and wash your hair at night. If you start wheezing, that's the point to come in urgently."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 331.03,
      "end_seconds": 333.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "Thank you, that's clear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 339.23,
      "end_seconds": 346.69,
      "duration_seconds": 7.46,
      "text": "I'd like you back in a month. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 347.46,
      "end_seconds": 351.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "So, great, thank you for your help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 352.67,
      "end_seconds": 353.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.17,
      "text": "Look after yourself."
    }
  ]
}